  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"In Political/Hydrological, I have imagined and illustrated a world where water is the basis for America's social structure. In this river-centered vision, watershed divides act as State boundaries, allowing citizens to locate themselves within the river networks upon which they depend instead of the arbitrarily designed political districts in which we currently envision ourselves."--Introduction.</subfield>
